<title>USA: Minimed names Gregg president/COO.</title>
<headline>Minimed names Gregg president/COO.</headline>
<dateline>SYLMAR, Calif 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MiniMed Inc said it promoted Terrance Gregg to President and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Gregg, 48, previously served as executive vice president, Operations. He joined the Company in September of 1994 as vice president regulatory affairs and clinical research.</p>
<p>Prior to joining MiniMed, Gregg spent nine years as vice president of governmental affairs for Ioptex Research, a division of Smith &amp; Nephew, plc.</p>
